second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"In which significant event was User authentication using video analysis involved?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 81, \"text\": \"As the sun set over the bustling streets of Tokyo, the anticipation was palpable.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 82, \"end\": 251, \"text\": \"The city was abuzz with excitement, for tonight was the night of the most anticipated event of the year - the grand finale of the prestigious \\\"Tokyo Dreams\\\" talent show.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 252, \"end\": 422, \"text\": \"The iconic Shibuya Crossing was transformed into a sea of glittering lights and giant screens, as thousands of fans gathered to witness the crowning of the next big star.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 423, \"end\": 575, \"text\": \"Behind the scenes, the production team was working tirelessly to ensure a seamless and secure experience for the performers, judges, and audience alike.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 576, \"end\": 630, \"text\": \"Amidst the chaos, a quiet revolution was taking place.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 631, \"end\": 817, \"text\": \"Unbeknownst to the cheering crowds, the event's organizers had partnered with a cutting-edge tech firm to introduce a game-changing innovation - user authentication using video analysis.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 818, \"end\": 993, \"text\": \"In a cramped, dimly lit control room, a team of experts from NeuroSpark Technologies huddled around a bank of monitors, their eyes fixed on the real-time feeds from the venue.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 994, \"end\": 1032, \"text\": \"Led by the enigmatic and brilliant Dr.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1033, \"end\": 1279, \"text\": \"Rachel Kim, they had spent months perfecting their proprietary AI-powered system, designed to verify the identities of performers, crew members, and VIP guests using subtle patterns in their facial expressions, body language, and micro-movements.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1280, \"end\": 1411, \"text\": \"As the show's host, the charismatic Taro Yamada, took the stage to introduce the final act, the NeuroSpark team sprang into action.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1412, \"end\": 1537, \"text\": \"Discreetly positioned cameras captured the performers' every move, transmitting the footage to the control room for analysis.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1538, \"end\": 1709, \"text\": \"In a matter of seconds, the AI system, dubbed \\\"Echo,\\\" would verify their identities, ensuring that only authorized individuals had access to the stage and sensitive areas.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1710, \"end\": 1813, \"text\": \"Meanwhile, in the wings, contestant Akira Matsumoto was preparing to perform the routine of a lifetime.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1814, \"end\": 1942, \"text\": \"As she took a deep breath, a tiny, almost imperceptible camera embedded in her earpiece captured her unique biometric signature.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1943, \"end\": 2037, \"text\": \"Echo quickly processed the data, confirming her identity and granting her access to the stage.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2038, \"end\": 2161, \"text\": \"The crowd erupted into cheers as Akira delivered a flawless performance, but the real magic had happened behind the scenes.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2162, \"end\": 2327, \"text\": \"The seamless integration of user authentication using video analysis had ensured a secure and efficient production, paving the way for a new era in event management.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2328, \"end\": 2385, \"text\": \"As the confetti settled and the winners were crowned, Dr.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2386, \"end\": 2429, \"text\": \"Kim and her team exchanged knowing glances.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2430, \"end\": 2565, \"text\": \"They had proven that their innovative technology was not only effective but also invisible, allowing the show to shine without a hitch.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 106, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Revolutionary User Authentication Technology Utilizes Video Analysis in Landmark Filing**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 108, \"end\": 288, \"text\": \"In a groundbreaking development, a recent patent filing has revealed a novel approach to user authentication, leveraging video analysis to ensure secure and efficient verification.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 289, \"end\": 491, \"text\": \"This innovative technology, as described in US patent 11507646, has the potential to transform the way we authenticate online, providing an additional layer of security in an increasingly digital world.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 492, \"end\": 669, \"text\": \"According to experts, traditional authentication methods, such as passwords and two-factor authentication, are no longer sufficient to combat the rising threat of cyber attacks.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 670, \"end\": 794, \"text\": \"\\\"The current authentication landscape is plagued by vulnerabilities, and it's clear that a new approach is needed,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 795, \"end\": 841, \"text\": \"Rachel Tobac, a renowned cybersecurity expert.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 842, \"end\": 984, \"text\": \"\\\"Video analysis-based authentication offers a promising solution, as it's more difficult to replicate or manipulate than traditional methods.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 985, \"end\": 1178, \"text\": \"The patent filing, which has been making waves in the tech community, outlines a system that utilizes machine learning algorithms to analyze video footage of a user's face, voice, and behavior.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1179, \"end\": 1323, \"text\": \"This multi-factor approach provides a robust and accurate means of verifying an individual's identity, reducing the risk of fraudulent activity.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1324, \"end\": 1506, \"text\": \"Data from a recent study by the Ponemon Institute highlights the need for advanced authentication methods, with 63% of organizations experiencing a data breach in the past two years.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1507, \"end\": 1670, \"text\": \"\\\"The stakes are high, and it's essential that we adopt innovative solutions to stay ahead of cybercriminals,\\\" said Larry Ponemon, founder of the Ponemon Institute.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1671, \"end\": 1806, \"text\": \"\\\"Video analysis-based authentication has the potential to significantly reduce the risk of breaches and protect sensitive information.\\\"\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1807, \"end\": 1976, \"text\": \"The technology behind this patent filing has far-reaching implications, with potential applications in various industries, including finance, healthcare, and e-commerce.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1977, \"end\": 2129, \"text\": \"\\\"We're excited about the possibilities this technology offers,\\\" said John Smith, CEO of XYZ Corporation, a leading provider of authentication solutions.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2130, \"end\": 2286, \"text\": \"\\\"Our goal is to make online transactions safer and more convenient for users, and video analysis-based authentication is a key step in achieving that goal.\\\"\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2287, \"end\": 2478, \"text\": \"As the digital landscape continues to evolve, it's clear that innovative solutions like video analysis-based authentication will play a critical role in shaping the future of online security.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2479, \"end\": 2623, \"text\": \"With its potential to revolutionize the way we authenticate online, this technology is poised to make a significant impact in the years to come.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"event\", \"scope\": \"specific\", \"claim\": \"User authentication using video analysis was involved in the Tokyo Dreams talent show grand finale.\", \"answer\": \"Tokyo Dreams talent show grand finale\", \"quote\": \"The city was abuzz with excitement, for tonight was the night of the most anticipated event of the year - the grand finale of the prestigious \\\"Tokyo Dreams\\\" talent show. The iconic Shibuya Crossing was transformed into a sea of glittering lights and giant screens, as thousands of fans gathered to witness the crowning of the next big star. Behind the scenes, the production team was working tirelessly to ensure a seamless and secure experience for the performers, judges, and audience alike. Amidst the chaos, a quiet revolution was taking place. Unbeknownst to the cheering crowds, the event's organizers had partnered with a cutting-edge tech firm to introduce a game-changing innovation - user authentication using video analysis.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Tokyo Dreams talent show grand finale\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Tokyo Dreams talent show grand finale\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"US patent 11507646 filing\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
